msgid ""
"Cut the solder trace on the back of the shield to disconnect P6 from the "
"backlight; the backlight is then permanently on."
msgstr ""
"Potong jalur solder pada bagian belakang shield untuk memutuskan P6 dari "
"backlight; backlight kemudian menyala secara permanen."

